    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-3",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Locale converts one canonical catalog to and from JSON,…",
      "text": "Locale converts one canonical catalog to and from JSON, World, Xcode String Catalogs (`.xcstrings`), Xcode `.strings` and `.stringsdict`, and Android `strings.xml`. A format either carries a feature—plurals, variables, status, key names—or fails with an explicit error. Nothing is dropped silently.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
