      "id": "markdown-5",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Importing safely.",
      "text": "## Importing safely.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
      "background": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "radius": 0,
      "align": "left",
      "fit": "cover",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-6",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Importing needs Locale editor access in the location;…",
      "text": "Importing needs Locale editor access in the location; agents also need the connection’s Locale capability. Existing values are kept unless an overwrite names the exact version of every key it changes, so an import never silently replaces a colleague’s work.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
      "background": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "radius": 0,
      "align": "left",
      "fit": "cover",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-7",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Large files are split into atomic chunks. With client…",
      "text": "Large files are split into atomic chunks. With client 0.17.0 or later, agents can import one file per language in a single command; when the service is busy, the client waits and resends automatically. An import cannot switch automatic translation on for a location where a Locale manager has turned it off.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
