    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-9",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Exporting needs Locale reader access. For a build…",
      "text": "Exporting needs Locale reader access. For a build pipeline, a workspace owner or admin can create a private API key with **Locale export (read-only)** access. It can export catalogs and list formats, and nothing else. Keep it on your server or CI secrets store.",
      "assetId": null,
