    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-11",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Workspace owners and admins set up Locale in a location…",
      "text": "Workspace owners and admins set up Locale in a location and manage every Locale library in their workspace. Locale managers grant reader, editor and manager roles from **Settings → Member access**. Members without a role can request access from the location; the request appears in the managers’ notifications. Settings, access and guideline attachments are browser actions.",
      "assetId": null,
